{"id":"3b8892bc156b282c","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-three-vars.md","title":"有序二进制词的一阶三变量性质","display":"thm-three-vars — 有序二进制词的一阶三变量性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-three-vars","aliases":["29-thm-three-vars"],"display":"thm-three-vars — 有序二进制词的一阶三变量性质","depends_on":["[[29-df-string-structures]]","[[29-df-lk]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 6.32, p.105; proof pp.106–107, DjVu scans 120–122","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及策略合并证明已核对"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-three-vars"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-three-vars</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-three-vars — 有序二进制词的一阶三变量性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 6.32, p.105; proof pp.106–107, DjVu scans 120–122"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及策略合并证明已核对"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{&lt;,S}\">\\(\\tau_{&lt;,S}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\">\\(\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^3_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\">\\(L^3_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}three\\text{-}vars}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\cap L^3_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\models\\varphi\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\models\\psi\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}three\\text{-}vars}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\cap L^3_{\\tau_{&lt;,S}}\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\models\\varphi\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathfrak A_w^{&lt;,S}\\models\\psi\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.32，印刷页 105，扫描页 120，允许线性序和任意一元谓词；证明见 pp.106–107，扫描页 121–122。本条是只取有限二进制词的闭句实例，不包含 BIT 或任意二元输入关系。证明通过合并中间卵石左右两个区间上的策略，得到三卵石等价蕴涵一阶等价；有限类型与紧致性步骤见 Lemma 6.30。本次核对陈述与证明结构，未重建其全部公式翻译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-string-structures","status":"resolved","id":"e8abb8daacc5641b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-string-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-lk]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-string-structures","status":"resolved","id":"e8abb8daacc5641b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{<,S}$ and $\\mathfrak A_w^{<,S}$ (see [[29-df-string-structures]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{<,S}}$ (see [[29-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^3_{\\tau_{<,S}}$ (see [[29-df-lk]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models$ (see [[29-df-satisfaction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_{<,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A_w^{<,S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{<,S}}","display":false},{"tex":"L^3_{\\tau_{<,S}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}three\\text{-}vars}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{<,S}}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\tau_{<,S}}\\cap L^3_{\\tau_{<,S}}\\;\n\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathfrak A_w^{<,S}\\models\\varphi\n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathfrak A_w^{<,S}\\models\\psi\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1605,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-log-depth]]、[[29-thm-three-vars]] — 并行深度与变量数刻画"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-three-vars]]"}],"outgoing":["e8abb8daacc5641b","4de7fc2c34b9d839","711217f22972ffc0","3ee556c64b16809b"]}